SUMMARY:Exit Only: WEMBLEY PARK STATION: Saturday 19 September\, between 
 2000 and 2110\, the station will be busy due to an American Football match
  at Wembley Stadium. The Bridge Road entrance will be exit only until the 
 queue to enter the station clears. Entry to the station\, including 
 step-free access via lift\, will be via Olympic Way. Please allow extra 
 time for your journey
END:VEVENT
